{"id":359,"slug":"359-generic-functions-voi-multiple-type-parameters-nhu-the-nao","category":"TypeScript","subcategory":"Generics","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Generic functions với multiple type parameters như thế nào?","question_en":"How do generic functions with multiple type parameters work?","answer_vi":"Hàm có thể có nhiều type params. Inference hoạt động độc lập cho mỗi param. Đặt tên rõ ràng (TKey, TValue) thay vì chỉ T, U, V khi có nhiều params.\n\n```typescript\nfunction zip<T, U>(a: T[], b: U[]): [T, U][] {\n  return a.map((item, i) => [item, b[i]]);\n}\nconst pairs = zip([1, 2], ['a', 'b']); // [number, string][]\n\nfunction getEntry<TObj, TKey extends keyof TObj>(obj: TObj, key: TKey): TObj[TKey] {\n  return obj[key];\n}\n```","answer_en":"Functions can have multiple type params. Inference works independently for each param. Use descriptive names (TKey, TValue) instead of just T, U, V when there are multiple params.\n\n```typescript\nfunction zip<T, U>(a: T[], b: U[]): [T, U][] {\n  return a.map((item, i) => [item, b[i]]);\n}\nconst pairs = zip([1, 2], ['a', 'b']); // [number, string][]\n\nfunction getEntry<TObj, TKey extends keyof TObj>(obj: TObj, key: TKey): TObj[TKey] {\n  return obj[key];\n}\n```","answer_html_vi":"<ul class=\"qa-points\"><li>Hàm có thể có nhiều type params.</li><li>Inference hoạt động độc lập cho mỗi param.</li><li>Đặt tên rõ ràng (TKey, TValue) thay vì chỉ T, U, V khi có nhiều params.</li></ul><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function zip&lt;T, U&gt;(a: T[], b: U[]): [T, U][] {\n  return a.map((item, i) =&gt; [item, b[i]]);\n}\nconst pairs = zip([1, 2], ['a', 'b']); // [number, string][]\n\nfunction getEntry&lt;TObj, TKey extends keyof TObj&gt;(obj: TObj, key: TKey): TObj[TKey] {\n  return obj[key];\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> zip&lt;T, U&gt;(<span class=\"hljs-attr\">a</span>: T[], <span class=\"hljs-attr\">b</span>: U[]): [T, U][] {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> a.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">map</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">item, i</span>) =&gt;</span> [item, b[i]]);\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> pairs = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">zip</span>([<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>], [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;a&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;b&#x27;</span>]); <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// [number, string][]</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> getEntry&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">TObj</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">TKey</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">extends</span> keyof <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">TObj</span>&gt;(<span class=\"hljs-attr\">obj</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">TObj</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">key</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">TKey</span>): <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">TObj</span>[<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">TKey</span>] {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> obj[key];\n}</code></pre></div>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Functions can have multiple type params.</p><ul class=\"qa-points\"><li>Inference works independently for each param.</li><li>Use descriptive names (TKey, TValue) instead of just T, U, V when there are multiple params.</li></ul><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function zip&lt;T, U&gt;(a: T[], b: U[]): [T, U][] {\n  return a.map((item, i) =&gt; [item, b[i]]);\n}\nconst pairs = zip([1, 2], ['a', 'b']); // [number, string][]\n\nfunction getEntry&lt;TObj, TKey extends keyof TObj&gt;(obj: TObj, key: TKey): TObj[TKey] {\n  return obj[key];\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> zip&lt;T, U&gt;(<span class=\"hljs-attr\">a</span>: T[], <span class=\"hljs-attr\">b</span>: U[]): [T, U][] {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> a.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">map</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">item, i</span>) =&gt;</span> [item, b[i]]);\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> pairs = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">zip</span>([<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>], [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;a&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;b&#x27;</span>]); <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// [number, string][]</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> getEntry&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">TObj</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">TKey</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">extends</span> keyof <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">TObj</span>&gt;(<span class=\"hljs-attr\">obj</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">TObj</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">key</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">TKey</span>): <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">TObj</span>[<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">TKey</span>] {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> obj[key];\n}</code></pre></div>","references":[{"label":"TypeScript — Generics","url":"https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/2/generics.html"},{"label":"TypeScript — Generic constraints","url":"https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/2/generics.html#generic-constraints"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/346-generics-trong-typescript-la-gi-tai-sao-can-thiet","title":"Generics trong TypeScript là gì? Tại sao cần thiết?"},{"url":"/q/347-generic-constraints-extends-trong-typescript-la-gi","title":"Generic constraints (extends) trong TypeScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/321-typescript-la-gi-va-tai-sao-nen-dung-typescript-thay-javascript","title":"TypeScript là gì và tại sao nên dùng TypeScript thay JavaScript?"},{"url":"/q/322-type-annotation-trong-typescript-la-gi","title":"Type annotation trong TypeScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/323-any-unknown-va-never-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao","title":"any, unknown và never khác nhau như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/324-union-types-va-intersection-types-la-gi","title":"Union types và intersection types là gì?"},{"url":"/q/325-literal-types-trong-typescript-la-gi","title":"Literal types trong TypeScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/327-type-narrowing-la-gi-cac-cach-narrow-type-trong-typescript","title":"Type narrowing là gì? Các cách narrow type trong TypeScript?"}]}